60\u00b0 Live-Streams in 3D - als w\u00e4rst du selbst da \nW\u00e4hle deinen Kamerawinkel jederzeit \n\nRiesige Events in Echtzeit: Bundesliga, Supercup, Festivals u.v.m. \nSprach- und Handsteuerung f\u00fcr maximale Immersion \n  \nBE THERE NOW. ", "short_description": "Sport & Konzerte in 360\u00b0 \u2013 be there now "}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "CoverImageSquare.png", "id": "1656216171741820", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819775_1656216175075153_2895559536759162680_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=b0qjYS7KoJEQ7kNvwFoJmx8&_nc_oc=AdrHhbtrWzeid8rKAVfHWv0QTnMXDfulp1iBfG6iRurCuLlOUaSpR5UgTsNxnptAbZ0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af0uNx2O4oqu4temifLRifAZSmPjS61nBVCioRYf_lgZ8g&oe=69DCDDD6"}, {"file_name": "CoverImagePortrait.png", "id": "1414326893195674", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821107_1414326896529007_8462027792716524313_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=idfqZaELA1QQ7kNvwEmVGFp&_nc_oc=Ado3b2NKKHBkASRvFsMGfKg4EE-CYkHsSCpEfwhIc0GmT4_FDNC82_bFHNU68n7IVb8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af2jN1775-2gBHxpIkv61Q2SJGvi9KCNiRfxQ7Utx4VSBg&oe=69DCE7AD"}, {"file_name": "L1VE_LOGO.png", "id": "1141925937781157", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491822789_1141925944447823_7424494728140263932_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=SBvTtMd1rJYQ7kNvwFFJ8ou&_nc_oc=AdphsNCwx6ZygF-mflDDfeVKqR_nL-ohBwecFa9CjuYmsCRzsvzJqDZWdm3W5Af_7Kw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af2tDNkJ5_c4HgwMvFgPiMyL9Ztt2RQIJQsoeJ6-_4hXHg&oe=69DCDFED"}, {"file_name": "Icon.png", "id": "996045819187461", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491820325_996045822520794_3628469034101667116_n.png?_nc_c